(Community Garden Notes) Tj
T*
(The community garden occupies the east corner of Riverside Park.) Tj
T*
(Volunteer work sessions take place on the first Saturday of each month at 9:00 AM.) Tj
T*
(The garden uses rainwater collected in two 500-litre tanks.) Tj
T*
(The tool shed is locked with a combination that is shared with registered volunteers.) Tj
T*
ET
