(Planting and harvest) Tj
T*
(Tomatoes are planted after the last frost, usually in late April.) Tj
T*
(Basil is planted beside tomatoes because the two crops share similar sunlight needs.) Tj
T*
(The first summer harvest is divided equally among volunteers who attended that month.) Tj
T*
(Excess produce is donated to the Riverside food pantry on Wednesday afternoons.) Tj
T*
ET
